(Page 3: Technical Architecture and Infrastructure) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The core indexing engine leverages FAISS with cosine similarity over 384-dimensional dense vectors.) Tj T*
(The default embedding model deployed is sentence-transformers all-MiniLM-L6-v2.) Tj T*
(The retrieval latency SLA is strictly under 150 milliseconds for 99 percent of requests.) Tj T*
(All enterprise data is encrypted using AES-256 at rest and TLS 1.3 in transit.) Tj T*
(The underlying vector index supports up to 10 million vector records per node.) Tj T*
