(Page 4: Security Policies and Compliance) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DocuMind strictly treats all retrieved document passages as untrusted user data.) Tj T*
(The system adheres to SOC2 Type II compliance and ISO 27001 certification standards.) Tj T*
(All session states are strictly isolated to avoid cross-tenant data leakage.) Tj T*
(System instruction injection attempts are blocked by prompt isolation boundaries.) Tj T*
(Compliance audits are conducted bi-annually by an independent security advisory board.) Tj T*
